PR gate of the harness Claude Code mod (claude-plugin/hooks/pr-detect.ts and claude-plugin/hooks/pr-gate.ts)

Parts of the shell reading (heredoc, quoted text and command substitution handling,
the command-start pattern, the unquote helper and the leading cd detection) are
adapted from co-op/hooks/review.ts of pourya7/claude-code-mods
